@startuml CU-10
actor "Administrador / Gestor de catálogo" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /suppliers" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» SupplierService / Supplier" as Model

Adm -> UI : 1: consultar proveedores
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /suppliers
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list_suppliers(db)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: list[SupplierRead]
Ctrl --> UI : 5: list[SupplierRead]
UI --> Adm : 6: proveedores mostrados

Adm -> UI : 7: registrar proveedor
UI -> Ctrl : 8: POST /suppliers
Ctrl -> Model : 9: create_supplier(db, data)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: SupplierRead
Ctrl --> UI : 11: SupplierRead
UI --> Adm : 12: proveedor registrado

Adm -> UI : 13: editar proveedor
UI -> Ctrl : 14: PATCH /suppliers/{id}
Ctrl -> Model : 15: update_supplier(db, id, data)
Model --> Ctrl : 16: SupplierRead
Ctrl --> UI : 17: proveedor actualizado
UI --> Adm : 18: confirmación

@enduml